# Hashed build assets must 404 when they are missing, never fall back to the SPA
# shell: a cached shell served under an asset URL poisons the browser for hours
# (observed 2026-11-03: a 4-hour max-age entry made the app a blank page).
/assets/*  /404.html  404
# Everything else is the app: deep links and client-side routes.
/*  /index.html  200
